\newlabel{sub@fig:shap_dep_dist_road@cref}{{[subfigure][1][23]23a}{[1][92][]93}}
\newlabel{fig:shap_dep_gpw}{{23b}{93}{SHAP dependence plot for \texttt {GPW} (population density). Population density ranks second in the South America RF SHAP ranking. Its mean SHAP contribution is $-0.025$ and 14.4\% of sampled observations are positive, consistent with populated or otherwise high-opportunity-cost pixels being less likely to enter the highest designation-risk tier.\relax }{figure.caption.91}{}}
